  H E L P

  :topics         list topics
  :brokers        list brokers
  :topic <name>   open a topic (or just :<name>)
  /               filter the list; start with _ to include internal topics
  enter           open the selected topic
  esc             clear filter, then go back
  j k ↑ ↓ g G     move
  ctrl+d          debug overlay: request budget
  q               quit

  CLI twins: kaas snapshot · kaas watch -t <topic>    any key closes













